================================================================================
                          ENUM VALUES REFERENCE
================================================================================

ORDER TYPE:
  • DINE_IN   - Customer eating at restaurant
  • PICKUP    - Customer taking food to go

ORDER STATUS:
  • NEW          - Just placed, not yet started
  • IN_PROGRESS  - Kitchen is preparing
  • READY        - Ready for serving/pickup
  • COMPLETED    - Order finished
  • CANCELLED    - Order cancelled

USER ROLES:
  • Admin
  • Kitchen
  • Cashier
  • Customer


================================================================================
                              API FUNCTIONS
================================================================================

Menu Operations:
  • getMenuItems()           - Get all menu items
  • subscribeToMenu()        - Real-time menu updates
  • addMenuItem()            - Add new menu item
  • updateMenuItemAvailability() - Toggle item availability
  • deleteMenuItem()          - Remove menu item

Order Operations:
  • getOrders()              - Get all orders
  • subscribeToOrders()      - Real-time order updates
  • createOrder()            - Create new order
  • updateOrderStatus()      - Update order status

User Operations:
  • getUserByUsername()      - Find user by username
  • createUser()             - Register new user


================================================================================
                              SUMMARY
================================================================================

This is a simple 3-collection Firebase Firestore database:

1. USERS   - Stores customer and staff information
2. MENU    - Stores available food items  
3. ORDERS  - Stores customer orders with embedded items

The system follows a real-time reactive pattern where changes to orders
and menu items are immediately reflected to all connected clients via
Firebase's onSnapshot functionality.

The order status flows from NEW → IN_PROGRESS → READY → COMPLETED,
or can be CANCELLED at any point.

